      "content": "Flaky tests usually point to environment instability. Start by adding verbose logging or detailed failure screenshots to your Jenkins job to capture all context during a failure. Then, try running the exact same test suite locally in a clean environment to see if the flakiness persists. This will help determine if the issue is inherent to the code/tests or specific to your CI environment.",
